{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://ion.dev/schemas/rpc/subscribe/_index.json",
  "title": "ION host 协议 — 订阅/事件流/host 级命令 schema 索引",
  "description": "S3 域（订阅/事件流/host 协议）的 schema 索引与契约清单。协议版本 PROTOCOL_VERSION=1（src/bin/ion.rs）。本目录所有 schema 均为 draft 2020-12，且刻意自包含（不使用跨文件 $ref），保证每个文件可独立编译。\n\n事件类型全集来源（穷举自源码产生点，非猜测）：\n- StreamingExtension（src/worker_rpc.rs）: text_delta/agent_start/agent_end/message_start/message_end/tool_call_delta/tool_execution_start/tool_execution_update/tool_execution_end/auto_retry_start/auto_retry_end\n- abort 路径（src/worker_rpc.rs）: agent_stopped；run 错误路径: error；初始化信号: worker_ready\n- ExtensionApi::emit（src/worker_api.rs）: custom\n- 各扩展发射（仿 BashExtension 模式）: extension_event（bash/permission/hooks/file-approval/workspace/session_probe/host-snapshot 等，customType 开放）\n- host registry（src/worker_registry.rs）: child_crashed（push_session_event 注入实例流）\n- worker RPC 摘要广播: rpc_response（emit_rpc_response_event）\n- tool_call 为遗留类型：在 Manager 泵转发白名单中（bin/ion.rs / worker_registry.rs），当前无产生点，保留枚举供旧流回放兼容",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "protocolVersion": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "domain": {
      "const": "subscribe",
      "description": "S3 域：订阅/事件流/host 级协议。S1（会话消息）/S2（worker 编排）/S4（配置/审批/快照/扩展）不在此目录"
    },
    "commands": {
      "description": "命令 schema 文件（请求+响应同文件，用 properties 划分）",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "enum": [
          "hello.json",
          "subscribe.json",
          "subscribe_overview.json",
          "ui_respond.json",
          "verb_pending.json",
          "verb_review.json",
          "approvals_pending.json",
          "approval_respond.json",
          "list_sessions.json",
          "get_overview.json"
        ]
      }
    },
    "frames": {
      "description": "events/ 目录全部 schema：订阅 ack / epoch 盖章帧 / 快照帧 / stale_route / ui 与 extension 流帧 / overview 推送 / rpc_response 事件 + 19 种内层事件的逐类型 schema（worker_event.json 为通用壳）+ 统一审批总线两事件 data 载荷 schema（approval_request/approval_resolved，与 overview.json 同为载荷级 schema，经 extension_event 帧 customType 传播）",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "enum": [
          "subscribed_ack.json",
          "instance_event.json",
          "snapshot_frame.json",
          "stale_route.json",
          "rpc_response_event.json",
          "ui_event_frame.json",
          "extension_event_frame.json",
          "overview.json",
          "overview_snapshot.json",
          "worker_event.json",
          "text_delta.json",
          "agent_start.json",
          "agent_end.json",
          "agent_stopped.json",
          "message_start.json",
          "message_end.json",
          "tool_call_delta.json",
          "tool_call.json",
          "tool_execution_start.json",
          "tool_execution_update.json",
          "tool_execution_end.json",
          "auto_retry_start.json",
          "auto_retry_end.json",
          "error.json",
          "worker_ready.json",
          "extension_event.json",
          "custom.json",
          "child_crashed.json",
          "approval_request.json",
          "approval_resolved.json"
        ]
      }
    },
    "innerEvents": {
      "description": "instance 流内层 event.type 枚举全集（19 种，含 1 个遗留类型 tool_call）",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "enum": [
          "text_delta",
          "agent_start",
          "agent_end",
          "agent_stopped",
          "message_start",
          "message_end",
          "tool_call_delta",
          "tool_call",
          "tool_execution_start",
          "tool_execution_update",
          "tool_execution_end",
          "auto_retry_start",
          "auto_retry_end",
          "error",
          "worker_ready",
          "extension_event",
          "custom",
          "child_crashed",
          "rpc_response"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "protocolVersion": 1,
      "domain": "subscribe",
      "commands": [
        "hello.json",
        "subscribe.json",
        "subscribe_overview.json",
        "ui_respond.json",
        "verb_pending.json",
        "verb_review.json",
        "approvals_pending.json",
        "approval_respond.json",
        "list_sessions.json",
        "get_overview.json"
      ],
      "frames": [
        "subscribed_ack.json",
        "instance_event.json",
        "snapshot_frame.json",
        "stale_route.json",
        "rpc_response_event.json",
        "ui_event_frame.json",
        "extension_event_frame.json",
        "overview.json",
        "overview_snapshot.json",
        "worker_event.json",
        "text_delta.json",
        "agent_start.json",
        "agent_end.json",
        "agent_stopped.json",
        "message_start.json",
        "message_end.json",
        "tool_call_delta.json",
        "tool_call.json",
        "tool_execution_start.json",
        "tool_execution_update.json",
        "tool_execution_end.json",
        "auto_retry_start.json",
        "auto_retry_end.json",
        "error.json",
        "worker_ready.json",
        "extension_event.json",
        "custom.json",
        "child_crashed.json",
        "approval_request.json",
        "approval_resolved.json"
      ],
      "innerEvents": [
        "text_delta",
        "agent_start",
        "agent_end",
        "agent_stopped",
        "message_start",
        "message_end",
        "tool_call_delta",
        "tool_call",
        "tool_execution_start",
        "tool_execution_update",
        "tool_execution_end",
        "auto_retry_start",
        "auto_retry_end",
        "error",
        "worker_ready",
        "extension_event",
        "custom",
        "child_crashed",
        "rpc_response"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
